title: Kemi got rejected
caption: Rejected from your dream scholarship? 💔 It's not the end. Ask for feedback, improve one thing, and apply again. Kemi's story will make you feel seen. Share this with someone who needs it ❤️ #scholarship #rejection #motivation #storytime
hook: "WE REGRET TO INFORM YOU..." | KEMI & QUDDUS
cta: KEEP GOING | 2b50 Rejection is redirection | 1f4dd Improve one thing, apply again
ctasay: Share this with a friend who got a rejection email, and comment AGAIN if you're trying again.
bye: Follow, and let's win the next one together!
cast: kemi

== park | RAINY AFTERNOON · PARK BENCH | quiet city park in light rain with wet benches, puddles and grey sky | bench
kemi (worried): Quddus, I got the email. We regret to inform you. Two years of preparing, and it took them one line to say no.
quddus (talk): I'm sorry, Kemi. That really hurts. It's okay to be sad today.
kemi (worried): Maybe people like me are not meant for these scholarships.
quddus (shock): No. Rejection is about one application, in one year, with limited spaces. It's not about your worth.

== cafe | A WEEK LATER · WARM CAFÉ | warm cozy café with fairy lights, plants and a rainy window | cafe
kemi (think): Okay. I'm ready to try again. Where do I start?
quddus (talk): First, ask politely if they give feedback. Then read your application with fresh eyes, or let someone you trust review it.
> 2b50 | AFTER A REJECTION | 1f4e9 Ask politely for feedback | 1f4dd Improve your weakest part | 1f30d Apply to more than one place
kemi (talk): And maybe I applied to only one place.
quddus (thumbs): Exactly. Apply to several good fits. Many winners were rejected before.
kemi (cheer): Round two. Same dream, better application!
